						],
						"pointId": 14229
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 100090901,
					"content": "Alright, we poured the growth serum on the flowers... Is that all we need to do?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090902,
					"content": "Yep. The flowers need to fully absorb the potion, so it might take some time before we see a reaction.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090903,
					"content": "What happens then?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090904,
					"content": "The flowers will grow in size while maintaining their original appearance. But then, when they reach 12 to 14 times their normal size, this will prove more than they can bear...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090905,
					"content": "As if some upper limit has been reached, they will wither and rot, assuming unnatural forms until nothing is left of them but liquid.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090906,
					"content": "Wait, what? So there's a problem with the growth serum, then!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090907,
					"content": "No. I've adjusted the formula time and again, resolving all kinds of issues that arise when inducing small plants to grow larger.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090908,
					"content": "Issues like... ensuring that the leaves don't get too large, strengthening root diameter and load-bearing capacity, calculating how the increase in surface area might affect sunlight exposure and nutrition...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090909,
					"content": "So why isn't it working, then?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090910,
					"content": "Because the flowers cannot transcend... \"As above, so below\" is one of alchemy's guiding principles. Alchemy seeks mastery over matter, but this world has its limits.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090911,
					"content": "It's like... a \"specification\" etched into the law that governs all things. Part of the purpose of doing multiple experiments is to determine if this \"specification\" is stable.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090912,
					"content": "So, \"failure\" is also a viable result...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090913
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100090913,
					"content": "Exactly. It proves that the limit \"continues to exist.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090914
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090914,
					"content": "Okay, this is all a bit over Paimon's head, but basically... You needed the experiment to fail to prove that the limits and borders in this world are stable?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090915
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090915,
					"content": "What a weird experiment... Huh? Looks like one of the flowers is reacting!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090916
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090916,
					"content": "Wait a second... That's not a Sweet Flower at all!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090917
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090917,
					"content": "Careful! I—It's a Whopperflower! It must have absorbed some of the potion. Wait. But that's happened before, and it's never gotten this big, either. Can this mean...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090918,
					"content": "We can talk about this later. Let's get rid of it first!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
