			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 100091101,
					"content": "Phew, we did it. Even at that size, a Whopperflower is just a Whopperflower.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091102,
					"content": "...Hmm.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091103,
					"content": "But, uh... was it supposed to get that big?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091104,
					"content": "I could only make a rough estimate during the battle, but it looked at least... 16 times its original size, maybe even larger.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091105,
					"content": "This means that the experiment... worked.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091106,
					"content": "Wait, but isn't that a good thing?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091107,
					"content": "I'm still not sure what the implications are... But if further attempts succeed in reproducing this result...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091108,
					"content": "That means that something's different... Perhaps the limits and laws of this world are changing due to some unknown factor...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091109,
					"content": "I can't say if that's good or bad, but from an alchemical perspective at least, expanded boundaries means that more possibilities are now open to us.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091110,
					"content": "Either way, this brings my task to an end.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091111,
					"content": "Seems so...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091112,
					"content": "Hmm. That said, it could also be an effect of the person who made the potion. There could also have been something special about this particular Whopperflower...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091113,
					"content": "There's a lot that still needs to be confirmed, so I suppose this task opens the way for further questions...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091114,
					"content": "Well, we're here if you ever need some help!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091115,
					"content": "Could we try using that growth serum on Paimon?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100091116,
					"content": "Hehe, just think about it... Paimon could probably beat a whole gang of Treasure Hoarders to a pulp if she were 16 times bigger!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091117,
					"content": "I have my doubts. The only reason the serum worked on the Whopperflower was because its internal structure was similar enough to a Sweet Flower... If you drank some...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091118,
					"content": "You might become 16 times bigger, but you might also turn into a plant-based lifeform.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091119,
					"content": "Yeah, nope. That's not happening, then...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091120,
					"content": "Oh, by the way, Paimon wanted to ask... Why is all your research focused on things like Sweet Flowers and Sunsettias?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091121,
					"content": "Oh, that's simple. Both Sunsettias and Sweet Flower nectar taste sweet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091122,
					"content": "So, in that sense, accidentally making a Whopperflower 16 times bigger comes with a hidden benefit, because Whopperflower Nectar...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091123,
					"content": "...Tastes exactly like Sweet Flowers?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091124,
					"content": "That's right! Once I've extracted the sugar from the nectar, I'll give you some.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100091125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sucrose"
				},
				{
					"id": 100091125,
					"content": "Hehe, you got it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		}
	]
